{"seq":3,"slug":"network-policies","title":"NetworkPolicy 微隔离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/orchestration/network-policies","wordCount":1130,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"networkpolicy-微隔离\">NetworkPolicy 微隔离</h1><p>Kubernetes 默认的扁平网络模型让集群内任何 Pod 可以与任何其他 Pod 自由通信——这对开发体验友好，但对安全而言是灾难性的。一个被攻破的前端 Pod 可以直接连接后端数据库、Redis 缓存、甚至控制平面的 etcd 端口。NetworkPolicy 实现了容器环境的&quot;网络微分段&quot;：将最小权限原则从进程级别延伸到网络级别，让每个 Pod 只能访问其业务逻辑真正需要的网络目标。Sysdig 2025 年报告显示 90% 的 Kubernetes 集群未部署任何 NetworkPolicy——这意味着绝大多数集群中，横向移动对攻击者几乎零成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>NetworkPolicy 的工作模型——从默认允许到显式授权：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[无 NetworkPolicy] --&gt; B[所有 Pod 互通-默认允许]&#10;&#10;    C[部署 default-deny] --&gt; D[所有流量被阻断]&#10;    D --&gt; E[逐条添加允许规则]&#10;    E --&gt; F[仅必要的通信路径开放]&#10;&#10;    subgraph 典型微服务隔离&#10;        G[frontend Pod] --&gt;|允许| H[api-server Pod]&#10;        H --&gt;|允许| I[database Pod]&#10;        G -.-&gt;|拒绝| I&#10;        G -.-&gt;|拒绝| J[redis Pod]&#10;        H --&gt;|允许| J&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[无 NetworkPolicy] --&gt; B[所有 Pod 互通-默认允许]\n\n    C[部署 default-deny] --&gt; D[所有流量被阻断]\n    D --&gt; E[逐条添加允许规则]\n    E --&gt; F[仅必要的通信路径开放]\n\n    subgraph 典型微服务隔离\n        G[frontend Pod] --&gt;|允许| H[api-server Pod]\n        H --&gt;|允许| I[database Pod]\n        G -.-&gt;|拒绝| I\n        G -.-&gt;|拒绝| J[redis Pod]\n        H --&gt;|允许| J\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>NetworkPolicy 特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>podSelector</td>\n<td>通过标签选择策略目标 Pod</td>\n<td>只能选择同 namespace 的 Pod</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>namespaceSelector</td>\n<td>选择允许通信的来源/目标 namespace</td>\n<td>需要 namespace 有正确标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ipBlock</td>\n<td>基于 CIDR 允许/拒绝 IP 范围</td>\n<td>不支持 DNS 名称</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ports</td>\n<td>限制协议和端口号</td>\n<td>L4 级别，无 L7 控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>policyTypes</td>\n<td>指定策略方向（Ingress/Egress）</td>\n<td>两者独立评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CNI 要求</td>\n<td>需要支持 NetworkPolicy 的 CNI</td>\n<td>非所有 CNI 都支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"default-deny-策略\">Default-Deny 策略</h2><p>安全的起点是为每个 namespace 部署 default-deny 策略，将默认行为从&quot;允许所有&quot;翻转为&quot;拒绝所有&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Default deny all ingress and egress&#10;apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1&#10;kind: NetworkPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: default-deny-all&#10;  namespace: production&#10;spec:&#10;  podSelector: {} # 匹配 namespace 中的所有 Pod&#10;  policyTypes:&#10;    - Ingress&#10;    - Egress\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Default deny all ingress and egress</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking.k8s.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">NetworkPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">default-deny-all</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  podSelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 匹配 namespace 中的所有 Pod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  policyTypes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Ingress</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Egress</span></span></code></pre></div><p>部署此策略后，该 namespace 中所有 Pod 的入站和出站流量都被阻断，直到有明确的 allow 规则覆盖。这是&quot;零信任网络&quot;在 Kubernetes 中的直接体现。</p>\n<p><strong>注意</strong>：default-deny 部署后，需要立即为关键通信路径（如 DNS 解析、业务间调用）添加 allow 规则，否则应用会立即中断。建议先在非生产 namespace 验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"精细化通信策略设计\">精细化通信策略设计</h2><p>一个典型的三层微服务架构的 NetworkPolicy 配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 允许 frontend 接收外部 Ingress 流量&#10;apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1&#10;kind: NetworkPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: allow-frontend-ingress&#10;  namespace: production&#10;spec:&#10;  podSelector:&#10;    matchLabels:&#10;      app: frontend&#10;  policyTypes: [&#39;Ingress&#39;]&#10;  ingress:&#10;    - from:&#10;        - namespaceSelector:&#10;            matchLabels:&#10;              kubernetes.io/metadata.name: ingress-nginx&#10;      ports:&#10;        - port: 8080&#10;          protocol: TCP&#10;---&#10;# 允许 api-server 仅接收来自 frontend 的流量&#10;apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1&#10;kind: NetworkPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: allow-api-from-frontend&#10;  namespace: production&#10;spec:&#10;  podSelector:&#10;    matchLabels:&#10;      app: api-server&#10;  policyTypes: [&#39;Ingress&#39;]&#10;  ingress:&#10;    - from:&#10;        - podSelector:&#10;            matchLabels:&#10;              app: frontend&#10;      ports:&#10;        - port: 3000&#10;          protocol: TCP&#10;---&#10;# 数据库仅接受 api-server 在 5432 端口的连接&#10;apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1&#10;kind: NetworkPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: allow-db-from-api&#10;  namespace: production&#10;spec:&#10;  podSelector:&#10;    matchLabels:&#10;      app: postgres&#10;  policyTypes: [&#39;Ingress&#39;]&#10;  ingress:&#10;    - from:&#10;        - podSelector:&#10;            matchLabels:&#10;              app: api-server&#10;      ports:&#10;        - port: 5432&#10;          protocol: TCP\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 允许 frontend 接收外部 Ingress 流量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking.k8s.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">NetworkPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">allow-frontend-ingress</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  podSelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">frontend</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  policyTypes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Ingress'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ingress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">namespaceSelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              kubernetes.io/metadata.name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ingress-nginx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8080</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          protocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">TCP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 允许 api-server 仅接收来自 frontend 的流量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking.k8s.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">NetworkPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">allow-api-from-frontend</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  podSelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api-server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  policyTypes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Ingress'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ingress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">podSelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">frontend</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          protocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">TCP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 数据库仅接受 api-server 在 5432 端口的连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking.k8s.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">NetworkPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">allow-db-from-api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  podSelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">postgres</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  policyTypes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Ingress'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ingress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">podSelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api-server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5432</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          protocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">TCP</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"dns-和外部访问的-egress-策略\">DNS 和外部访问的 Egress 策略</h2><p>Egress 策略容易被忽视但同样重要——限制 Pod 的出站连接可以有效阻止数据泄露和 C2 通信：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 允许所有 Pod 访问集群 DNS&#10;apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1&#10;kind: NetworkPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: allow-dns&#10;  namespace: production&#10;spec:&#10;  podSelector: {}&#10;  policyTypes: [&#39;Egress&#39;]&#10;  egress:&#10;    - to:&#10;        - namespaceSelector:&#10;            matchLabels:&#10;              kubernetes.io/metadata.name: kube-system&#10;          podSelector:&#10;            matchLabels:&#10;              k8s-app: kube-dns&#10;      ports:&#10;        - port: 53&#10;          protocol: UDP&#10;        - port: 53&#10;          protocol: TCP&#10;---&#10;# api-server 允许访问外部 API（特定 CIDR）&#10;apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1&#10;kind: NetworkPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: allow-api-external&#10;  namespace: production&#10;spec:&#10;  podSelector:&#10;    matchLabels:&#10;      app: api-server&#10;  policyTypes: [&#39;Egress&#39;]&#10;  egress:&#10;    - to:&#10;        - ipBlock:&#10;            cidr: 203.0.113.0/24 # 外部 API 服务的 IP 范围&#10;      ports:&#10;        - port: 443&#10;          protocol: TCP\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 允许所有 Pod 访问集群 DNS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking.k8s.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">NetworkPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">allow-dns</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  podSelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  policyTypes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Egress'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  egress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">namespaceSelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              kubernetes.io/metadata.name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kube-system</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          podSelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              k8s-app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kube-dns</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">53</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          protocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UDP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">53</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          protocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">TCP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># api-server 允许访问外部 API（特定 CIDR）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking.k8s.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">NetworkPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">allow-api-external</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  podSelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api-server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  policyTypes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Egress'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  egress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">ipBlock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            cidr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">203.0.113.0/24</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 外部 API 服务的 IP 范围</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">443</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          protocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">TCP</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"cni-选择与高级网络安全\">CNI 选择与高级网络安全</h2><p>NetworkPolicy 的执行依赖 CNI 插件的实现。不同 CNI 的能力差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CNI</th>\n<th>标准 NetworkPolicy</th>\n<th>L7 策略</th>\n<th>加密</th>\n<th>DNS 策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Calico</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n<td>通过 Calico NetworkPolicy</td>\n<td>WireGuard</td>\n<td>支持 FQDN 规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cilium</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n<td>内置 CiliumNetworkPolicy</td>\n<td>IPsec/WireGuard</td>\n<td>支持 DNS-aware</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>IPsec</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flannel</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Cilium 的高级能力</strong>：CiliumNetworkPolicy 超越了标准 NetworkPolicy 的限制，支持 L7（HTTP/gRPC）级别的策略、DNS 名称匹配（而非 IP）、以及 Pod 间自动 mTLS 加密。对于需要精细控制的场景（如&quot;api-server 只能对 database 发送 SELECT 查询&quot;），Cilium 是更好的选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"策略可视化与调试\">策略可视化与调试</h2><p>NetworkPolicy 的复杂性在于其&quot;加法&quot;模型——多条策略的效果叠加，很难从 YAML 直接推断最终的允许/拒绝行为。有效的工具：</p>\n<p><strong>Hubble UI</strong>（Cilium 生态）：实时显示 Pod 间的通信流和 NetworkPolicy 决策（允许/拒绝），直观展示哪些连接被阻断。</p>\n<p><strong>Network Policy Editor</strong>（Cilium 开源 Web 工具）：以可视化方式设计 NetworkPolicy，自动生成对应的 YAML。</p>\n<p><strong>kubectl 审计</strong>：<code>kubectl describe networkpolicy</code> 查看策略的最终匹配规则，<code>kubectl get events</code> 检查是否有因策略导致的连接拒绝。</p>\n<p>调试流程：应用无法通信 → 检查 Pod 标签是否匹配策略的 podSelector → 检查来源 Pod 是否匹配 ingress.from → 检查端口和协议是否匹配 → 检查 namespace 标签。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动化策略生成\">自动化策略生成</h2><p>手动为每个微服务编写 NetworkPolicy 在大规模集群中不可持续。自动化方案：</p>\n<p><strong>基于观测生成</strong>：先部署 Hubble/Calico 观测一段时间的实际通信模式，然后基于观测数据自动建议 NetworkPolicy。</p>\n<p><strong>Kyverno generate</strong>：新 namespace 创建时自动生成 default-deny 策略（如上一篇中的 generate 策略示例）。</p>\n<p><strong>GitOps 模板化</strong>：为不同的应用 tier（frontend/backend/database）准备策略模板，部署时通过 Helm values 参数化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>90% 的集群无 NetworkPolicy，横向移动对攻击者零成本</li>\n<li>Default-deny 是起点——将默认行为从&quot;允许所有&quot;翻转为&quot;拒绝所有&quot;</li>\n<li>Egress 策略同样关键——阻止数据泄露和 C2 通信</li>\n<li>CNI 选择影响策略能力：Cilium 提供 L7、DNS 和加密的高级特性</li>\n<li>可视化工具（Hubble）和自动化生成是大规模管理 NetworkPolicy 的必需</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"admission-control-kyverno\">准入控制与 Kyverno</a>——用 generate 策略自动化 NetworkPolicy 创建</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../devops-containerization/kubernetes-essentials/services-and-ingress\">Kubernetes Services 与 Ingress</a>——NetworkPolicy 所保护的 Kubernetes 网络模型基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"NetworkPolicy 微隔离","id":"networkpolicy-微隔离"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Default-Deny 策略","id":"default-deny-策略"},{"level":2,"text":"精细化通信策略设计","id":"精细化通信策略设计"},{"level":2,"text":"DNS 和外部访问的 Egress 策略","id":"dns-和外部访问的-egress-策略"},{"level":2,"text":"CNI 选择与高级网络安全","id":"cni-选择与高级网络安全"},{"level":2,"text":"策略可视化与调试","id":"策略可视化与调试"},{"level":2,"text":"自动化策略生成","id":"自动化策略生成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"准入控制与 Kyverno","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/orchestration/admission-control-kyverno"},"next":null}